# A large ID3 tag can hide the first MPEG frame beyond the bounded sample.
# This identifies a candidate only; ffprobe still validates its actual container.
0 string ID3 ID3-tagged media candidate
!:mime application/x-libretorio-id3
!:strength -20
# A real executable signature is not an ambiguous DOS COM heuristic.
0 string MZ DOS executable
!:mime application/x-libretorio-executable
!:strength +100
0 string ZM DOS executable
!:mime application/x-libretorio-executable
!:strength +100
